# OS / editor cruft
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
*.bak
*.swp
features/

# Harness runtime: isolated worktrees. Transient, never committed.
.claude/worktrees/

# Generated GitHub Copilot translation. Derived from skills/, rules/ and CLAUDE.md — rebuild with
# `node scripts/build-copilot.mjs .`. See docs/adr/0003 for why it is no longer committed.
github_build/

# VS Code extension build. `node_modules/` is the only third-party code this repo ever pulls, and it
# is dev-only: the hook script it ships is node builtins. The .vsix is a build artifact of `out/`.
extension/node_modules/
extension/out/
extension/*.vsix

# `self-improve`'s log and its archive. Runtime DATA the skill writes, per machine — the base stays in
# the repo as the `*.template.md` beside them, the entries never do. Untracked from 20260805 on.
skills/self-improve/findings.md
skills/self-improve/findings-archive.md
